  <section id="author">
    <h2>Author</h2>
    <p class="kicker">Preethika Reddy Mandadi</p>
    <p>Preethika Reddy Mandadi is the chief executive officer of Medifakt, Hyderabad, India. Her interests include consent infrastructure, health data governance, and authorization for AI agents.</p>
    <p><a href="mailto:preethika@medifakt.com">preethika@medifakt.com</a> · ORCID: <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0003-9341-9379">0009-0003-9341-9379</a></p>
    <p><strong>Disclosure.</strong> Medifakt builds consent and health-data infrastructure. This paper draws on that experience; it describes no Medifakt product and makes no claims about one.</p>

